  "definition_ja": "関数 g の値を関数 f に入れてできる関数 f(g(x))。",
  "definition_en": "The function f(g(x)) formed by feeding the output of g into f.",
  "latex": "(f \\circ g)(x) = f(g(x))",
  "spoken_en": "f composed with g of x equals f of g of x",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "f of g of x means you do g first, then f.",
      "ja": "f(g(x)) は、先に g、次に f を施す。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the composite function (f ∘ g)(x) for f(x) = x² and g(x) = x + 1.",
      "ja": "f(x) = x²、g(x) = x + 1 のとき、合成関数 (f ∘ g)(x) を求めよ。",
